dance [Internet]. 2020 [cited 2021 Apr 22]. Available from: https://www.acgme.org/Portals/0/Documents/COVID-19/SurgCOVID19LTC.pdf 10. Bartley GB. Verifying Surgical Competence: Our Fiduciary Responsibility. Ophthalmology. 2020 Aug;127(8):997–9. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] 11. Gedde SJ, Volpe NJ, Feuer WJ, Binenbaum G. Ophthalmology Resident Surgical Competence: A Survey of Program Directors. Ophthalmology. 2020;127(8):1123–5. doi: 10.1016/j.ophtha.2020.02.017. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 12. Stride HP, George BC, Williams RG, Bohnen JD, Eaton MJ, Schuller MC, et al. Relationship of procedural numbers with meaningful procedural autonomy in general surgery residents. Surgery. 2018;163(3):488–94. doi: 10.1016/j.surg.2017.10.011. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 13. The Accreditation Council for Graduate Medical Education. Ophthalmology Milestones [Internet]. 2020 [cited 2021 Apr 29]. Available from: https://www.acgme.org/Portals/0/PDFs/Milestones/OphthalmologyMilestones.pdf 14. Golnik KC, Lee AG, Wilson MC. A national program director survey of the shift to competency-based education in ophthalmology. Ophthalmol 2008;115(8):1426–30, 1430.e1-2. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] 15. Wentzell DD, Chung H, Hanson C, Gooi P. Competency-Based Education Assessment Tools for Laser Capsulotomy, Peripheral Iridotomy, and Selective Laser Trabeculoplasty. Ophthalmol Glaucoma. 2019;2(3):179–87. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] 16. Stulberg JJ, Huang R, Kreutzer L, Ban K, Champagne BJ, Steele SR, Johnson JK, Holl JL, Greenberg CC, Bilimoria KY. Association Between Surgeon Technical Skills and Patient Outcomes. JAMA Surg. 2020;155(10):960–968. 10.1001/jamasurg.2020.3007. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Supplementary Materials Additional file 1. (15.4KB, docx) Data Availability Statement The datasets generated and/or analysed during the current study are availa